        <headline>Small Craft Advisory issued September 26 at 8:55AM EDT until September 27 at 2:00AM EDT by NWS Newport/Morehead City NC</headline>
        <description>* WHAT...Northwest winds 15 to 25 kt and seas 4 to 7 ft.

* WHERE...The coastal waters from Ocracoke Inlet to Surf City.

* WHEN...Until 2 AM EDT Sunday.

* IMPACTS...Conditions will be hazardous to small craft.
</description>
        <instruction>Inexperienced mariners, especially those operating smaller
vessels, should avoid navigating in hazardous conditions.</instruction>
